Fry @onion{1%medium}(sliced) until soft but not brown. Add the @mushrooms{110%g}(sliced) and cook. Empty vegetables onto another plate.

Fry the @rump steak{225%g}(sliced).

Add the vegetables and @soured cream{140%g}. Season with @salt and @pepper.